  <h1>Hustle Street Support</h1>

  <p>Need help with Hustle Street? Email us at <a href="mailto:support@abrensystems.com">support@abrensystems.com</a>. We usually reply within 2 business days.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>

  <h3>How do I restore my purchases?</h3>
  <p>Open the Shop in the game and tap Restore. Make sure you are signed in to the same Apple or Google account you bought with.</p>

  <h3>How do I turn off anonymous stats?</h3>
  <p>Go to Settings → Share anonymous game stats, and switch it off.</p>

  <h3>I lost my progress.</h3>
  <p>Progress is saved on your device only. Deleting the app or clearing its data removes it, and we can’t recover it.</p>

  <h3>Refunds?</h3>
  <p>Apple and Google handle refunds for purchases made in their stores:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>App Store: <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com">reportaproblem.apple.com</a></li>
    <li>Google Play: <a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/2479637">Google Play refund help</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>Read the <a href="/hustle-street/privacy">Hustle Street Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <p class="meta">Hustle Street is published by Abren Systems LLC, New Mexico, United States.</p>
